    questionText: "Outline a way that returning to the original teaching of Jesus of Nazareth helped two of the following movements to rediscover the message of Jesus for themselves: ● Céli Dé ● Early 19th century Protestantism ● Liberation Theology ● Luther ● The Mendicant Orders ● The Second Vatican Council",
